        "description": "EMG demonstrating myopathic changes",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "serum-creatine-kinase",
        "description": "Elevated serum creatine kinase (CK) levels",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive proximal limb-girdle muscle weakness plus either muscle biopsy findings consistent with telethonin deficiency or identification of pathogenic TCAP variants",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation is considered definitive; muscle biopsy may be bypassed if genetic testing is conclusive."
